            </note>
            <note corresp="#d360-f2" n="50" xml:id="d360-f2-content">
                <p>Willys R. Peck, Counselor of Legation and Consul General at Nanking.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d360-f3" n="51" xml:id="d360-f3-content">
                <p>Generalissimo Chiang Kai-shek, Chairman of the Chinese Military Council and
                    Commander in Chief of the Army, Navy, and Air Forces.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
